EXAMPLE_CRATE(1)

# NAME

EXAMPLE_CRATE - the scaffold's placeholder binary

# SYNOPSIS

*EXAMPLE_CRATE*

# DESCRIPTION

*EXAMPLE_CRATE* is the scaffold's placeholder; replace this page as the program
grows.

The page lives in _doc/cli.1.scd_ and is built by scdoc into the *manpages*
package under _share/man/man1/_, named after the crate. Add further pages as
_doc/\*.N.scd_ for section N.

# NAME LINE

The first line under NAME is "_name_ - _summary_", on one line, short enough to
render untruncated in a manpage index. *doppelgang lint-man* checks every page
against that contract (_just lint-manpage-names_).
